      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Each Reactor LongLive-2.0 Chain node is one beat: it plays its prompt for its frames, starting where the beat before it ends. The first link sets the model and its settings, later links take them from the chain, and the last one feeds Reactor Render.\n\nkind is how a beat enters from the one before: shot blends softly, cut starts a fresh scene. The first beat just opens the video.\n\nSet your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
